    "updated_at": "2022-03-08T16:14:07Z",
    "body": "I don't think we have any signal that this is moving forward in browsers, unfortunately, due to it just being low-priority sugar for browser teams. As such I don't think it'll land in Fetch, at least until a couple of browsers have engineers looking for starter projects.\r\n\r\nI'd really encourage you to use this as a case study for https://github.com/whatwg/js-hosts . Figure out what sort of documentation you want to create there, which would enable you to land such things with confidence, and go for it! I'm happy to participate and secure guarantees like \"Chromium will never ship a `Response.json()` with different semantics than those specified here\".",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
